'''Rose''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 600 [[Hearts (Currency)|Hearts]] {{Currency|Heart}} during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white with a wavy pink spine. The guard is golden, and the handle is white with a pink and golden diamond strap over it.

== Trivia ==

* This is considered the knife version of [[Sakura]].
